ID  - 42709513
TI  - Vagal activity-related events and glucagon-like peptide-1 receptor agonists.
AU  - Al-Ansary Lina
AU  - Kinnberg Nielsen Sebastian
AU  - Hashiba Jensen Mads
AU  - Nouhravesh Nina
AU  - Sindet-Pedersen Caroline
AU  - Gislason Gunnar
