TI  - GLP-1 receptor agonist use during immune checkpoint inhibitor therapy is associated with mortality and Immune-Related adverse events across cancer types in People with type 2 Diabetes: A Target-Trial emulation.
AU  - Chan Shan-Ho
AU  - Li Pei-Yun
AU  - Li Pin-Hung
AU  - Lin Yu-Jung
AU  - Wang Wei-Hsun
AU  - Huang Yu-Nan
